      "id": "sol.hmmt-feb-calculus-2003-p3.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "1001/1002\nThe two curves intersect at \\((0,0)\\) and \\((1,1)\\), so the desired area is\n\n\\[\\int_{0}^{1}\\left(x^{1 / 2003}-x^{2003}\\right) d x=\\left[\\frac{x^{2004 / 2003}}{2004 / 2003}-\\frac{x^{2004}}{2004}\\right]_{0}^{1}=\\frac{1001}{1002}\\]",
